Co-Authored-by: Filipe Casal <filipe.casal@trailofbits.com>
Reviewed-by: Tomas Mraz <tomas@openssl.foundation>
Reviewed-by: Andrew Dinh <andrewd@openssl.org>
Reviewed-by: Eugene Syromiatnikov <esyr@openssl.org>
